==Battleground==
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Mistress Celeboodle]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Devil Wife]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Professor A.]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The hardest part of this stage is not falling asleep. Kill the triple Celeboodles for cash, then just use [[Cyberpunk Cat]] to chip down Professor A. while you speedrun kill each Aku Gory. [[Fallen Bear Cat]] is ideal, but [[Can Can Cat]], [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Maize Cat]] and [[Jelly Dumpling Cat]] also works.
Alternatively, Golfer cheese is an option. Bring Crazed Cat, and 3 cheap meatshields with low damage and [[Little Leaguer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Golfer Cat]]. Due to the Celeboodles clogging the enemy limit, Golfer will easily destroy the base while the Celeboodles are stalled.

